 First, I think that we have to remember that LLMs,","tokens":[50587,2386,11,286,519,300,321,362,281,1604,300,441,43,26386,11,50699],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2685546875,"compression_ratio":1.7615658044815063,"no_speech_prob":0.00002668674278538674},{"id":23,"seek":5724,"start":63.97999954223633,"end":67.18000030517578,"text":" there is, of course, some random factor there","tokens":[50701,456,307,11,295,1164,11,512,4974,5952,456,50861],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2685546875,"compression_ratio":1.7615658044815063,"no_speech_prob":0.00002668674278538674},{"id":24,"seek":5724,"start":67.19999694824219,"end":70.44000244140625,"text":" since they are based on probabilistic processes.","tokens":[50862,1670,436,366,2361,322,31959,3142,7555,13,51024],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2685546875,"compression_ratio":1.7615658044815063,"no_speech_prob":0.00002668674278538674},{"id":25,"seek":5724,"start":70.4800033569336,"end":75.04000091552734,"text":" But our goal is to try and make them as deterministic as possible.","tokens":[51026,583,527,3387,307,281,853,293,652,552,382,15957,3142,382,1944,13,51254],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2685546875,"compression_ratio":1.7615658044815063,"no_speech_prob":0.00002668674278538674},{"id":26,"seek":5724,"start":75.08000183105469,"end":78.30000305175781,"text":" And I think the honest answer is that we're not there yet.","tokens":[51256,400,286,519,264,3245,1867,307,300,321,434,406,456,1939,13,51417],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2685546875,"compression_ratio":1.7615658044815063,"no_speech_prob":0.00002668674278538674},{"id":27,"seek":5724,"start":78.33999633789062,"end":80.63999938964844,"text":" And we see that what we're trying to build,","tokens":[51419,400,321,536,300,437,321,434,1382,281,1322,11,51534],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2685546875,"compression_ratio":1.7615658044815063,"no_speech_prob":0.00002668674278538674},{"id":28,"seek":5724,"start":80.68000030517578,"end":82.18000030517578,"text":" when I talked about harnesses before,","tokens":[51536,562,286,2825,466,19700,279,949,11,51611],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2685546875,"compression_ratio":1.7615658044815063,"no_speech_prob":0.00002668674278538674},{"id":29,"seek":5724,"start":82.19999694824219,"end":86.63999938964844,"text":" is really to make sure that regardless of the probabilistic nature","tokens":[51612,307,534,281,652,988,300,10060,295,264,31959,3142,3687,51834],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2685546875,"compression_ratio":1.7615658044815063,"no_speech_prob":0.00002668674278538674},{"id":30,"seek":8664,"start":86.63999938964844,"end":88.27999877929688,"text":" of the LLM,","tokens":[50364,295,264,441,43,44,11,50446],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23448608815670013,"compression_ratio":1.6996337175369263,"no_speech_prob":0.00005224865162745118},{"id":31,"seek":8664,"start":88.30000305175781,"end":92.19999694824219,"text":" we want to make sure that it actually reproduces the...","tokens":[50447,321,528,281,652,988,300,309,767,11408,887,264,485,50642],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23448608815670013,"compression_ratio":1.6996337175369263,"no_speech_prob":0.00005224865162745118},{"id":32,"seek":8664,"start":92.23999786376953,"end":93.9800033569336,"text":" can run it deterministically.","tokens":[50644,393,1190,309,15957,20458,13,50731],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23448608815670013,"compression_ratio":1.6996337175369263,"no_speech_prob":0.00005224865162745118},{"id":33,"seek":8664,"start":94.0,"end":96.87999725341797,"text":" Of course, when you are a vendor that creates products,","tokens":[50732,2720,1164,11,562,291,366,257,24321,300,7829,3383,11,50876],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23448608815670013,"compression_ratio":1.6996337175369263,"no_speech_prob":0.00005224865162745118},{"id":34,"seek":8664,"start":96.9000015258789,"end":100.54000091552734,"text":" it's hard to sell something that might give different answers.","tokens":[50877,309,311,1152,281,3607,746,